  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "AshwinK1",
      "content": "It's been a roller coaster ride watching this movie especially watching second half was full of laughing riot along with such a feel good movie. Atharva was spot on in this movie especially this story suits him so well especially with his looks and acting. Female casts Preity Mukhundhan acting and look was top notch. After seeing action packed Blast movie this was complete turn around as an actor and rocked the screens with great acting and expressions. Kayadu Lohar (as seen in Dragon movie) role was really nice and nice selection for this movie.\\\r\n\\\r\nFahadh Faasil was a silent listener in first half and his epic role came into picture in the second half with his ever charming and flawless acting and rocked the screens completely with his presence and elevated the movie and story to different level.\\\r\n\\\r\nAtharva maturity in acting is seen in this movie and he was so apt for this role and acted so well with purpose and lived to the expectations. Other casts like Natty Natarajan, Rakshan, Sudhakar Jeyaraman blended so well in the story and acting was so nice to see.\\\r\n\\\r\nOverall, such a nice feel good movie and freshness in story, casts & shooting location. This is such a romantic, light hearted, full of laughter and enjoyable movie to witness in big screen.",
      "rating": 8,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-27T07:06:54Z"
    }
  ],
